  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Bundle. Made with love. Serilum's mods combined, for easier downloading!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the bundle\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Client Bundle</strong> 是一种特殊类型的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>客户端类型</strong>模组整合到一个文件中。虽然将我的模组归类在一起非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了方便安装。它使用了一种称为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，即 Jar 包内嵌 Jar 包）的系统。这意味着包含的模组保持完全独立，但允许像整合包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏的模组列表中看到它们全部。<br><br>该捆绑包是整合包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不替代我个人更喜欢的模块化模组系统。不过，可以通过捆绑包的配置文件禁用包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它与正常安装该模组以及同时安装该模组和捆绑包中包含的模组都兼容。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，但如果以这种方式意外安装了两次模组，也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此捆绑包，可以移除其他已包含在此捆绑包中的模组。<br><br>希望这个捆绑包对喜欢内容更丰富的模组的你们有所帮助。非常感谢多年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Client\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary><span><strong>enableAdvancementScreenshot</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCurrentGameMusicTrack</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFullBrightnessToggle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGlobalNarrationToggle</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUIClock</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUICompass</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGUIFollowers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHideHands</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableImprovedSignEditing</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableOmegaMute</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePassiveShield</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePersistentInventorySearch</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVanillaZoom</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Available Bundles\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下 Serilum 模组捆绑包可用：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Client Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Customization Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Extra Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's QoL Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's RPG Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Spawn Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Mods included\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/advancement-screenshot.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/advancement-screenshot\" target=\"_blank\">Advancement Screenshot</a></td>\n<td>每次获得成就时截取屏幕截图。记录你的进度！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/current-game-music-track.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/current-game-music-track\" target=\"_blank\">Current Game Music Track</a></td>\n<td>通过 GUI 临时显示当前正在播放的歌曲标题。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/full-brightness-toggle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/full-brightness-toggle\" target=\"_blank\">Full Brightness Toggle</a></td>\n<td>按 G 键在游戏内切换亮度/伽马值为最大值，获得全亮夜间视野。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/global-narration-toggle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/global-narration-toggle\" target=\"_blank\">Global Narration Toggle</a></td>\n<td>自动使旁白设置跨实例全局生效。关闭并打开屏幕。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-clock.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-clock\" target=\"_blank\">GUI Clock</a></td>\n<td>在 GUI/HUD 中显示游戏时间/天数，物品栏中有一个时钟。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-compass.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-compass\" target=\"_blank\">GUI Compass</a></td>\n<td>在 GUI/HUD 中显示方向和坐标，物品栏中有一个指南针。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/gui-followers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gui-followers\" target=\"_blank\">GUI Followers</a></td>\n<td>在 GUI/HUD 中列出周围所有驯服但未坐下的追随者列表。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hide-hands.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hide-hands\" target=\"_blank\">Hide Hands</a></td>\n<td>在第一人称视角下隐藏副手和/或主手，可选择在手持特定物品（如火把、不死图腾或盾牌）时隐藏。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/improved-sign-editing.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/improved-sign-editing\" target=\"_blank\">Improved Sign Editing</a></td>\n<td>更好的告示牌编辑功能。输入时在下一行和上一行之间切换。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/omega-mute.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/omega-mute\" target=\"_blank\">Omega Mute</a></td>\n<td>你唯一需要的模组，用于完全控制游戏内的各个声音。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-shield.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passive-shield\" target=\"_blank\">Passive Shield</a></td>\n<td>盾牌被隐藏，并在副手中闲置时被动提供保护。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/persistent-inventory-search.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/persistent-inventory-search\" target=\"_blank\">Persistent Inventory Search</a></td>\n<td>使搜索查询在切换标签页和关闭界面期间保留在创造模式物品栏中。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/vanilla-zoom.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanilla-zoom\" target=\"_blank\">Vanilla Zoom</a></td>\n<td>使用望远镜物品添加即时缩放功能的快捷键。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载文件仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此捆绑包。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>对于问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
